{"id":55865,"ord":92,"n_segments":127,"prev":55864,"next":55866,"doc":{"id":"68097","title":"68097_Freddie Green oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Freddie Green","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/68097/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=68097"},"chapter":"War years and postwar changes","title":"The 1944-45 band line-up","category":"band_or_employer","summary":"Stanley Dance reads off personnel, with Greene recalling nicknames like Mutton-Leg.","period":"1944-45","year_from":1944,"year_to":1944,"words":354,"start":[184,3],"end":[186,20],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=68097#s55865","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Count Basie Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":"Count Basie"}]},"people":[{"name":"Louis Taylor","qid":null,"n":7},{"name":"Harry Edison","qid":"Q289821","n":3},{"name":"Lucky Thompson","qid":"Q1349922","n":3},{"name":"Dicky Wells","qid":"Q350879","n":3},{"name":"Ted Donnelly","qid":"Q7693144","n":3},{"name":"Buck Clayton","qid":"Q999321","n":2},{"name":"Jack Washington","qid":"Q6115675","n":2},{"name":"Earle Warren","qid":"Q1277478","n":2},{"name":"Rudy Rutherford","qid":"Q30017114","n":2},{"name":"Eli Robinson","qid":"Q16079040","n":2},{"name":"Jimmy Powell","qid":"Q16079142","n":2},{"name":"Lester Young","qid":"Q110714","n":1},{"name":"Buddy Tate","qid":"Q358700","n":1},{"name":"Earl Hines","qid":"Q354883","n":1},{"name":"Shadow Wilson","qid":"Q356886","n":1},{"name":"Ed Lewis","qid":"Q1282398","n":1},{"name":"Rodney Richardson","qid":"Q2161188","n":1},{"name":"Stanley Dance","qid":"Q741323","n":1},{"name":"Joe Newman","qid":"Q356176","n":1},{"name":"Al Killian","qid":"Q1524457","n":1}],"story":{"theme":34,"theme_name":"Who was in the band: naming sidemen and personnel","community":60,"community_name":"Who played in the band: reciting personnel","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":184,"b":3,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Who was in the band during the period that Shadow came in?"},{"p":184,"b":4,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"[What tunes?]"},{"p":184,"b":5,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"No, who was in the band when Shadow came in?"},{"p":184,"b":6,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Huh?"},{"p":184,"b":7,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Oh. When Shadow -- let me see --"},{"p":184,"b":9,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Ed Lewis, Al Killian --"},{"p":184,"b":10,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Mm hmm."},{"p":184,"b":11,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Harry Edison, Joe Newman, Dickie Wells, Ted Donelly --"},{"p":184,"b":12,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Who?"},{"p":184,"b":13,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Ted Donelly."},{"p":184,"b":14,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Oh, Ted, yeah. Mutton-Leg. Yeah."},{"p":184,"b":15,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Mutton-Leg?"},{"p":184,"b":16,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. That's what we used to call him."},{"p":184,"b":17,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Why?"},{"p":184,"b":18,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"I don't know whether Dickie Wells or somebody gave him that name. But, I don't know why, you know."},{"p":184,"b":19,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Sounds like Dickie, doesn't it?"},{"p":184,"b":20,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. Who else was in there?"},{"p":185,"b":0,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Eli Robinson --"},{"p":185,"b":1,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Eli -- yeah."},{"p":185,"b":2,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Louis Taylor, Earl Warren, Jimmy Powell."},{"p":185,"b":3,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Taylor? Who did you say?"},{"p":185,"b":4,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Hm?"},{"p":185,"b":5,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"You said something --"},{"p":185,"b":6,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"What Taylor did you say?"},{"p":185,"b":7,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Louis Taylor -- trombone. Louis Taylor."},{"p":185,"b":8,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Louis Taylor. Did you know him at all?"},{"p":185,"b":9,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Yeah, played with Earl Hines at one time."},{"p":185,"b":10,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Louis Taylor -- Oh, yes, yes. Louis Taylor."},{"p":185,"b":11,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"He was a studious looking fellow."},{"p":185,"b":12,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah, yeah, yeah. Skinny. Light complexion. Kind of semi-bald."},{"p":185,"b":13,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"That's right. Yeah."},{"p":185,"b":14,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. Louis."},{"p":185,"b":15,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":185,"b":16,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Okay. Alright -- you're refreshing my memory."},{"p":185,"b":17,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Earl, and Jimmy Powell, Buddy Tate, Lucky Thompson."},{"p":185,"b":18,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Lucky -- yeah."},{"p":185,"b":19,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"And, Rudy Rutherford."},{"p":185,"b":20,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Oh, yeah."},{"p":185,"b":21,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Good God."},{"p":185,"b":22,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"And, Rodney Richardson, and Shadow. Now that's '44."},{"p":185,"b":23,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"But, that's such a terrific lot of changes."},{"p":185,"b":24,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Oh, yeah, that's --"},{"p":185,"b":25,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"That's all kind of new people."},{"p":186,"b":0,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":186,"b":1,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"I mean -- who went out for all those people to come in?"},{"p":186,"b":2,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Did Harry Edison go in The Army?"},{"p":186,"b":3,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Well they're listed here in the"},{"p":186,"b":4,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Huh? Oh."},{"p":186,"b":5,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Buck Clayton did."},{"p":186,"b":6,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Buck did, yeah. Now, Harry wasn't there during that period?"},{"p":186,"b":7,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Oh wait a minute, I beg pardon, Sweets is there."},{"p":186,"b":8,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. I knew he had to be there, yeah."},{"p":186,"b":9,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Well, Stanley, with all those saxophones -- all those reeds you read out -- who went out then?"},{"p":186,"b":10,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Well, Lester had gone, so they've got Lucky Thompson. And, Jack Washington's gone and we've got Rudy Rutherford on baritone --"},{"p":186,"b":11,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Why had Jack Washington gone?"},{"p":186,"b":12,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"In the Army?"},{"p":186,"b":13,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"[ ] yes he did."},{"p":186,"b":14,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"[ ]"},{"p":186,"b":15,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":186,"b":16,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Oh."},{"p":186,"b":17,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Gosh. He sure did"},{"p":186,"b":18,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yes. He sure did."},{"p":186,"b":19,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"[ ]"},{"p":186,"b":20,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yes."}]}